fixture dash_down_ramp45_onto_crest_lip
doc Physics review 8 (BUILD.md s5 Dash, 180 u in 9 f; Ground, corner correction). A ground dash left down the 45-degree ramp of test/ramp45_crest_lip into the face of the door laid 4 u below the plateau, met with the centre at x 183 and the door's top 5 u above the feet: the dash steps up onto the door and runs on along it at 20 u every tick. Before the fix the lift was measured to the plateau the trailing foot zone still rested in, 9 u above the feet, and the dash parked at the door's face.
room test/ramp45_crest_lip
spawn 230 192
frames 16
input
  0 L dash
  1..15 L
end
expect
  at 1 state=dash xu=190 yu=194
  at 2 state=dash xu=170 yu=196
  at 8 state=dash xu=50 yu=196
  at 12 xu=11 yu=196
  never 0..15 state=air
  never 0..12 hit_wall=-1
end
